      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Collaborations between the Wlodawer and Skalka laboratories have covered a period of almost 30 years. During that time our groups have co-authored 18 publications, including several much cited journal articles, book chapters, and scholarly reviews. It has therefore been most rewarding for us to share enthusiasm, insights, and expertise with our Frederick colleagues over the years, and also to enjoy lasting friendships."},
